      "created_at": "2012-08-28T07:54:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not 100% sure how these cards work. Does Imbued Vitality basically turn all Ongoing and Equipment cards into Targets, which as a result can be eaten by Raptors, shot by Assault Rifles, etc.?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ghostly Images can put One-Shots in play. Does putting a One-Shot in play have any effect?</p>",
