      "created_at": "2012-08-28T12:23:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The important difference to realize is that you can \"put a card into play\" even when you can't \"play cards,\" so you can use it even when an environment says you can't. On the other hand, Take Down (non-EE, at least) doesn't prevent Omnitron repairing drones or the Operative summoning underbosses.</p>",
